  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Gitano is a mystic from Sami, tarot expert and a great card player. She has never spoken to anyone of her past prior to coming to Rhodes Island, and it remains a mystery. All anyone knows is that her readings are very accurate.",
        "zh": "萨米出身的神秘学家，最擅长塔罗占卜，也玩得一手好牌。从不向别人透露任何来到罗德岛之前的故事，因此过往成谜。人们所被允许知道的，只有她占卜很成功这一点。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests for this Operator showed blurry outlines of internal organs with visible dark spots. Unusually high concentrations of Originium particles were present in her circulatory system, indicating infection and confirming her as Infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 5% \nThe infection could be related to Operator Gitano's arcane abilities, though this has yet been proven. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.3u/L \nInfection approaching mid-stage, Originium beginning to have physical effects that are not obvious.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】5%\n远山的神秘学能力可能与感染有关，但尚无确切证据。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.3 u/L\n感染步入中期，源石开始影响身体机能但并不明显。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A fortune teller cannot tell her own future, but she can read the omens and guide her choices. She has the power to create devastating explosions with her Originium crystal ball, but she must also withstand the backlash.",
        "zh": "占卜者无法占卜自己的未来，但通过预兆远山能够做些准备。在进行法术攻击时，可以通过激发源石水晶球进行爆发性杀伤，只是，释放完力量后，需要接受足以抑制行动的反噬。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Divination is a hobby to Gitano that she does almost for free, accepting fruits and cakes as tokens of payment. Her clients ask for readings on anything from the future to a misplaced key. Just like any soothsayer, Gitano gives ambiguous answers that require some careful thought to decipher.",
        "zh": "占卜对于远山来说是一种乐趣，她不收取金钱报酬，只会取个水果或蛋糕作为“对方付出的代价”。至于占卜内容，大到命运，小到钥匙丢哪里都可以问，和其他占卜师一样，远山给出的回答也是那种模棱两可的预言，稍微思考一下，就能对答案有个一知半解。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Unlike her relaxed composure during a reading, Gitano gets anxious easily and becomes very competitive when playing cards. She is never allowed to shuffle the deck out of fear that she'll cheat. Even then, she knows countless other card tricks, and unless she's caught red-handed, she'll never admit to cheating. Still, some people play with her because they either want to catch her in the act, or see a nervous side of her she doesn't otherwise show.",
        "zh": "和占卜时轻松的姿态不同，玩牌类游戏时的远山是个容易紧张且求胜心极强的人，因为怕她洗牌时作弊，这个过程总是由别人来完成，即使如此，凭借她对“牌”的熟悉，能够让她做手脚的环节仍旧多到数不胜数，除非被抓现行，她绝不会承认自己动过手脚。不过，有些人依旧喜欢同她打牌，一类是喜欢抓她的出千的瞬间，另一类，则只是喜欢看她那不常见的紧张表情。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    }
  ]
}
